00:31:27.090 --> 00:31:29.980
I get high on my own supply.

00:31:29.980 --> 00:31:34.980
I have no interest in letting
anybody have leverage over me.

00:31:35.740 --> 00:31:38.250
So in a world where all my employees

00:31:38.250 --> 00:31:39.830
