00:33:24.900 --> 00:33:26.865
I really want it, I want it.

00:33:26.865 --> 00:33:29.180
And I think it's selfish and not like,

00:33:29.180 --> 00:33:30.440
I don't think it's special.

00:33:30.440 --> 00:33:31.770
I just think it's the way I was wired

00:33:31.770 --> 00:33:34.410
